    "Also learns a reusable rule for future charging at this location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also learns a reusable rule for future charging at this location."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时学习此地点以后充电可复用的价格规则。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时学习此地点以后充电可复用的价格规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple map and geocoding services process map locations. When route weather is requested, precise route coordinates are sent to Open-Meteo for app functionality. Open-Meteo may retain request logs for up to 90 days and states that it does not link them to user identities or use them for tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple map and geocoding services process map locations. When route weather is requested, precise route coordinates are sent to Open-Meteo for app functionality. Open-Meteo may retain request logs for up to 90 days and states that it does not link them to user identities or use them for tracking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果地图和地理编码服务会处理地图位置。请求沿途天气时，应用会将精确路线坐标发送给第三方开放气象服务以提供天气功能。该服务可能将请求日志保留最长 90 天，并声明不会将其关联到用户身份或用于跟踪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果地图和地理编码服务会处理地图位置。请求沿途天气时，应用会将精确路线坐标发送给第三方开放气象服务以提供天气功能。该服务可能将请求日志保留最长 90 天，并声明不会将其关联到用户身份或用于跟踪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
